# .gitignore for Aethrix-Labs/.github — the org-level CI plumbing repo.
#
# Derived from ~/products/gitignore.baseline (STANDARDS §2.4), trimmed to what this repo
# can actually produce: it holds reusable workflow YAML and a README, and nothing here
# builds, installs or tests, so the baseline's build/cache, coverage and Node blocks are
# deliberately omitted.
#
# `.claude/` is the load-bearing entry. Its absence is why bb8f086 committed a full copy of
# every workflow under `.claude/worktrees/phase-1e/`, which then drifted into a stale
# pre-#59 duplicate a reader or an agent could grep and believe — the tracked-stale-copy trap
# of STANDARDS §18.1a. Agent worktrees and session state are runtime artifacts of working in
# this repo; they are never part of it.

# --- Claude ---
.claude/
.commit_state

# --- OS noise ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Editor / IDE metadata ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.vs/
.history/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Secrets (nothing here should ever hold one; cheap insurance anyway) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
.secrets/

# --- Misc ---
*.bak
*.orig
*.log
